    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ace3e9b957b34cd5b4d2d216ffa941ff",
      "statement": "The empty apiUrl invariant matters because a URL committed to main on the starter would become the service every new clone talks to; the committed environment.ts keeps apiUrl empty so each clone shows the 'configure your service' screen and configures its own service locally.",
